{"id": "7th-t2-pyq-q266", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "lesson-09-tamil-olir-idangal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-pyq-libraries-year-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்நாட்டின் புகழ்பெற்ற நூலகங்களையும் அவை தொடங்கப்பட்ட / அறியப்பட்ட ஆண்டுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) சரசுவதி மகால் நூலகம் - 1. பொ.ஆ. 1896\n(b) கீழ்த்திசை நூலகம் - 2. பொ.ஆ. 1122 முதல்\n(c) கன்னிமாரா நூலகம் - 3. பொ.ஆ. 1942\n(d) உ.வே.சா நூலகம் - 4. பொ.ஆ. 1869"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-4, c-2, d-3", "B": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "D": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்:\nசரசுவதி மகால் = பொ.ஆ. 1122 முதல் (2)\nகீழ்த்திசை நூலகம் = பொ.ஆ. 1869 (4)\nகன்னிமாரா நூலகம் = பொ.ஆ. 1896 (1)\nஉ.வே.சா நூலகம் = பொ.ஆ. 1942 (3).\nவரிசை: 2, 4, 1, 3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the renowned libraries of Tamil Nadu with their established / recorded years:\n(a) Saraswathi Mahal Library - 1. 1896 CE\n(b) Oriental Manuscripts Library - 2. Since 1122 CE\n(c) Connemara Library - 3. 1942 CE\n(d) U.Ve.Sa Library - 4. 1869 CE"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-4, c-2, d-3", "B": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "D": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "Correct alignment: Saraswathi Mahal = 1122 CE (2), Oriental Library = 1869 CE (4), Connemara = 1896 CE (1), U.Ve.Sa = 1942 CE (3). Sequence: 2, 4, 1, 3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "சரசுவதி மகால் நூலகம்", "content_en": "Saraswathi Mahal Library"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "கீழ்த்திசை நூலகம்", "content_en": "Oriental Manuscripts Library"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "கன்னிமாரா நூலகம்", "content_en": "Connemara Public Library"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "உ.வே.சா நூலகம்", "content_en": "U.Ve.Sa Library"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "பொ.ஆ. 1896", "content_en": "1896 CE"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "பொ.ஆ. 1122 முதல்", "content_en": "Since 1122 CE"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "பொ.ஆ. 1942", "content_en": "1942 CE"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "பொ.ஆ. 1869", "content_en": "1869 CE"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "2", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 34, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": true, "exam": "TNPSC Group 4 / Group 2", "exam_name": "TNPSC Combined Civil Services", "year": "2014-2024", "paper": "General Tamil", "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["pyq", "libraries", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t2-pyq-q267", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-u2-kalai", "lesson_id": "lesson-07-pesum-oviyangal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-pyq-art-forms-regions-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் ஓவியக் கலை இடங்களையும் அவற்றின் சிறப்புகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) சித்தன்னவாசல் - 1. தஞ்சாவூர் கலைஞர்கள்\n(b) தஞ்சைப் பெரிய கோவில் - 2. சேரமான் நாயனார் வரலாறு\n(c) தந்த ஓவியங்கள் - 3. கேரள மாநில மன்னர்கள்\n(d) கண்ணாடி ஓவியங்கள் - 4. சமணர்கள் வாழ்ந்த குகை"}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "B": "a-4, b-1, c-3, d-2", "C": "a-4, b-2, c-3, d-1", "D": "a-3, b-2, c-4, d-1"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்:\nசித்தன்னவாசல் = சமணர்கள் வாழ்ந்த குகை ஓவியம் (4)\nதஞ்சைப் பெரிய கோவில் = சேரமான் நாயனார் வரலாறு (2)\nதந்த ஓவியங்கள் = கேரள மாநில மன்னர்கள் காலத்தில் அதிகம் (3)\nகண்ணாடி ஓவியங்கள் = தஞ்சாவூர் கலைஞர்கள் சிறப்பு (1).\nவரிசை: 4, 2, 3, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the art locations with their distinct attributes:\n(a) Sittannavasal - 1. Thanjavur artisans\n(b) Thanjavur Big Temple - 2. Cheraman Nayanar history\n(c) Ivory paintings - 3. Kerala kings\n(d) Glass paintings - 4. Jain caves"}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "B": "a-4, b-1, c-3, d-2", "C": "a-4, b-2, c-3, d-1", "D": "a-3, b-2, c-4, d-1"}, "explanation": "Correct match: Sittannavasal = Jain caves (4), Thanjavur Temple = Cheraman Nayanar (2), Ivory paintings = Kerala kings (3), Glass paintings = Thanjavur artisans (1). Sequence: 4, 2, 3, 1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "சித்தன்னவாசல்", "content_en": "Sittannavasal"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "தஞ்சைப் பெரிய கோவில்", "content_en": "Thanjavur Big Temple"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "தந்த ஓவியங்கள்", "content_en": "Ivory paintings"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "கண்ணாடி ஓவியங்கள்", "content_en": "Glass paintings"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "தஞ்சாவூர் கலைஞர்கள்", "content_en": "Thanjavur artisans"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "சேரமான் நாயனார் வரலாறு", "content_en": "Cheraman Nayanar life history"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "கேரள மாநில மன்னர்கள்", "content_en": "Kerala state rulers"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "சமணர்கள் வாழ்ந்த குகை", "content_en": "Jain ascetic caves"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "2", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 23, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": true, "exam": "TNPSC Group 4 / Group 2", "exam_name": "TNPSC Combined Civil Services", "year": "2014-2024", "paper": "General Tamil", "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["pyq", "art_history", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previ