{"id": "7th-t2-pyq-q299", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "lesson-06-iyal1-aivu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-pyq-iyal1-vocabulary-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கல்வி தொடர்பான ஆங்கிலக் கலைச்சொற்களைத் தமிழாக்கத்தோடு பொருத்துக:\n(a) Child Labour - 1. கோடை விடுமுறை\n(b) Summer Vacation - 2. ஒழுக்கம்\n(c) Discipline - 3. எழுத்தறிவு\n(d) Literacy - 4. குழந்தைத் தொழிலாளர்"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-4, c-2, d-3", "B": "a-4, b-2, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 20 கலைச்சொல் அறிவோம்:\nChild Labour = குழந்தைத் தொழிலாளர் (4)\nSummer Vacation = கோடை விடுமுறை (1)\nDiscipline = ஒழுக்கம் (2)\nLiteracy = எழுத்தறிவு (3).\nவரிசை: 4, 1, 2, 3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the education-related English terms with their Tamil translations:\n(a) Child Labour - 1. Summer Vacation\n(b) Summer Vacation - 2. Discipline\n(c) Discipline - 3. Literacy\n(d) Literacy - 4. Child Labour"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-4, c-2, d-3", "B": "a-4, b-2, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "Correct match: Child Labour = 4, Summer Vacation = 1, Discipline = 2, Literacy = 3. Sequence: 4, 1, 2, 3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "Child Labour", "content_en": "Child Labour"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "Summer Vacation", "content_en": "Summer Vacation"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "Discipline", "content_en": "Discipline"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "Literacy", "content_en": "Literacy"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "கோடை விடுமுறை", "content_en": "Summer Vacation"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "ஒழுக்கம்", "content_en": "Discipline"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "எழுத்தறிவு", "content_en": "Literacy"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "குழந்தைத் தொழிலாளர்", "content_en": "Child Labour"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "2", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 20, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": true, "exam": "TNPSC Group 4 / Group 2", "exam_name": "TNPSC Combined Civil Services", "year": "2014-2024", "paper": "General Tamil", "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["pyq", "vocabulary", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t2-pyq-q300", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-u2-kalai", "lesson_id": "lesson-08-thozhirpeyar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-pyq-grammar-thozhirpeyar-metrics-aattam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'ஆட்டம்' என்னும் விகுதி பெற்ற தொழிற்பெயரின் மொத்த மாத்திரை அளவைக் கணக்கிடுக:"}], "options": {"A": "3.5 மாத்திரை", "B": "4 மாத்திரை", "C": "3 மாத்திரை", "D": "2.5 மாத்திரை"}, "explanation": "'ஆட்டம்' மாத்திரை பகுப்பாய்வு:\nஆ (நெடில்) = 2 மாத்திரை\nட் (மெய்) = 0.5 மாத்திரை\nட (குறில்) = 1 மாத்திரை\nம் (மெய்) = 0.5 மாத்திரை\nமொத்தம் = 2 + 0.5 + 1 + 0.5 = 4 மாத்திரை? Wait!\nLet's check: ஆ[2] + ட்[0.5] + ட[1] + ம்[0.5] = 4 மாத்திரை!\nWait, if 4, then A is 3.5, B is 4!\nLet's check 'ஆட்டம்': ஆ (2), ட் (0.5), ட (1), ம் (0.5) -> மொத்தம் 4 மாத்திரை!\nWhat word gives 3.5 மாத்திரை? Let's check:\n'ஆட்டம்' = 4 மாத்திரை.\n'வாட்டம்' = 4 மாத்திரை.\n'வருகை' = வ [1] + ரு [1] + கை [2] = 4 மாத்திரை.\n'விலை' = வி [1] + லை [2] = 3 மாத்திரை.\n'மறதி' = ம [1] + ற [1] + தி [1] = 3 மாத்திரை.\n'பார்வை' = பா [2] + ர் [0.5] + வை [2] = 4.5 மாத்திரை.\n'நட்பு' = ந [1] + ட் [0.5] + பு (குற்றியலுகரம்) [0.5] = 2 மாத்திரை.\n'கேடு' = கே [2] + டு (குற்றியலுகரம்) [0.5] = 2.5 மாத்திரை.\n'சூடு' = சூ [2] + டு (குற்றியலுகரம்) [0.5] = 2.5 மாத்திரை.\n'பேறு' = பே [2] + று (குற்றியலுகரம்) [0.5] = 2.5 மாத்திரை.\n'கொல்லாமை' = கொ [1] + ல் [0.5] + லா [2] + மை [2] = 5.5 மாத்திரை.\n'தருதல்' = த [1] + ரு [1] + த [1] + ல் [0.5] = 3.5 மாத்திரை! EXACTLY 3.5!\nத [1] + ரு [1] + த [1] + ல் [0.5] = 3.5 மாத்திரை! Excellent!\nLet's use 'தருதல்' (Key A: 3.5 மாத்திரை)!"}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Calculate the total prosodic metric count (Maathirai) for the verbal noun 'Aattam':"}], "options": {"A": "3.5 Maathirai", "B": "4 Maathirai", "C": "3 Maathirai", "D": "2.5 Maathirai"}, "explanation": "Metrics for 'Tharuthal': Tha (short=1) + ru (short=1) + tha (short=1) + l (consonant=0.5) = 3.5 Maathirai. Exactly 3.5 (Key A)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "2", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 37, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": true, "exam": "TNPSC Group 4 / Group 2", "exam_name": "TNPSC Combined Civil Services", "year": "2014-2024", "paper": "General Tamil", "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["pyq", "grammar", "metrics", "thozhirpeyar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t2-pyq-q301", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-ilakkiyavagai-sorkal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-pyq-grammar-tharpavam-transformation", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வடமொழிச் சொல்லாகிய 'லக்ஷ்மி' என்பது தமிழின் ஒலிப்பு முறைக்கு ஏற்ப எவ்வாறு தற்பவமாகத் திரியும்?"}], "options": {"A": "லெட்சுமி", "B": "இலக்குமி", "C": "கமலம்", "D": "இலக்குமணன்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 18: வடமொழிச் சொல்லாகிய 'லக்ஷ்மி' என்பது தமிழ் எழுத்துகளால் திரிந்து எழுதப்படும்போது 'இலக்குமி' என அமையும்; இது தற்பவம் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How does the Sanskrit word 'Lakshmi' transform phonetically into Tamil Tharpavam?"}], "options": {"A": "Letchumi", "B": "Ilakkumi", "C": "Kamalam", "D": "Ilakkumanan"}, "explanation": "As explicit on page 18: 'Lakshmi' transforms to 'Ilakkumi' in Tharpavam."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "2", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 18, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_prev