{"id": "7th-t2-pyq-q303", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-ilakkiyavagai-sorkal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-pyq-grammar-sol-definitions", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஓர் எழுத்து தனித்தோ பல எழுத்துகள் சேர்ந்தோ பொருள் தரும் வகையில் அமைவது 'சொல்' எனப்படும். இதற்குரிய வேறு பெயர்களில் தவறானது எது?"}], "options": {"A": "மொழி", "B": "பதம்", "C": "கிளவி", "D": "யாப்பு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 16: மொழி, பதம், கிளவி என்பன சொல் என்னும் பொருள் தரும் வேறு பெயர்களாகும். 'யாப்பு' என்பது செய்யுள் இலக்கண உறுப்பு; சொல்லின் வேறு பெயர் அன்று."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "A letter standing singly or combined with other letters yielding meaning is 'Sol'. Which of the following is NOT an alternative term for Sol?"}], "options": {"A": "Mozhi", "B": "Padham", "C": "Kilavi", "D": "Yaappu"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 16: Mozhi, Padham, Kilavi are synonyms for Sol. Yaappu means prosody/verse, not Sol. Option D is incorrect."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "2", "edition": "2024-2025", 